Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-02-2001||06:54 PM||||I can do a write up in word about what to do as soon as I can, and then I'll email it to you.  It would be too long to post in here I think.  Currently, Black86SE (Travis) and I are doing an auto to Isuzu 5 speed swap into his 86SE.  We've already got the engine/tranny/cradle out of the car and just this saturday we got the trans and engine off the cradle.  We're doing painting and a little bit of rebuilding to his engine until we start to assemble it again.  James, FieroMaster88 has already done a 2.5L Auto to a V6 5 Speed swap, maybe he'll post in here too.  There are a lot of parts you need and a lot of time involved, but it is possible!  James got it done in 1 week, but he was very tired and grumpy after that week!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'll email you what I know about it as soon as I can.<P>BTW, we all live in MI too, maybe we can stop by sometime, we'll see.||||reg||1
